WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:07,620
That's Lin Yu Xiaoxue

2
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:15,160
You're here, grandpa

3
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,190
The young man who just went out to buy something

4
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,190
you don't know

5
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:19,190
There was a young man just now

6
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,190
I bought more than 20 pieces of jade food at once

7
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,190
I still feel like I got a huge discount.

8
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:24,190
Something made of jade residue

9
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,220
Wholesale only costs one yuan each

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,220
It bought twenty for fifty yuan

11
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,220
You really dare to sell it

12
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,220
He picked it himself

13
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:33,220
I didn't force his brother

14
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,220
you are back
